---
// EthicsAccountability: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 340;
---
<figure class="eac">
  <div class="eac-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two chains. Left: you, an officer, an appeal path. Right: you, a model, and an unanswered question of who is responsible. Below, GDPR Article 22 and the EU AI Act ask for human review, audit logs and oversight.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Who answers for the decision?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ai chịu trách nhiệm cho quyết định?</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>The same mortgage refusal, decided by a person and by a model.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một lần bị từ chối vay, do người quyết định và do mô hình quyết định.</tspan></text>
      <line x1="450" y1="64" x2="450" y2="206" class="grid" />
      <text x="20" y="76" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Human decision</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Người quyết định</tspan></text>
      <text x="470" y="76" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Automated rejection</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hệ thống tự động từ chối</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="88" width="108" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="user" x={74} y={113} size={26} />
      <text x="74" y="146" class="bh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>You</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bạn</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 128 123 L 167.0 123.0" /><polygon points="172,123 165.7,126.0 165.7,120.0" /></g>
      <rect x="172" y="88" width="108" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={226} y={113} size={26} />
      <text x="226" y="146" class="bh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Officer</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Người xét</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 280 123 L 319.0 123.0" /><polygon points="324,123 317.7,126.0 317.7,120.0" /></g>
      <rect x="324" y="88" width="108" height="70" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={378} y={113} size={26} />
      <text x="378" y="146" class="bh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Appeal path</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khiếu nại</tspan></text>
      <rect x="470" y="88" width="108" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="user" x={524} y={113} size={26} />
      <text x="524" y="146" class="bh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>You</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bạn</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 578 123 L 617.0 123.0" /><polygon points="622,123 615.7,126.0 615.7,120.0" /></g>
      <rect x="622" y="88" width="108" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="model" x={676} y={113} size={26} />
      <text x="676" y="146" class="bh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Model</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mô hình</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 730 123 L 769.0 123.0" /><polygon points="774,123 767.7,126.0 767.7,120.0" /></g>
      <rect x="774" y="88" width="108" height="70" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={828} y={113} size={26} />
      <text x="828" y="146" class="bh red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Who answers?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ai trả lời?</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="182" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>Someone owns the call</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Có người đứng tên quyết định</tspan></text>
      <text x="470" y="182" class="redtxt"><tspan data-lang-en>No name, no appeal path</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không ai đứng tên, không đường khiếu nại</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="226" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>What the law now asks</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Luật hiện nay yêu cầu gì</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="238" width="430" height="80" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <DiagramIcon name="shield" x={48} y={278} size={26} />
      <text x="76" y="260" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>GDPR Article 22</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GDPR Điều 22</tspan></text>
      <text x="76" y="278" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Safeguards for purely automated decisions</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Có biện pháp bảo vệ với quyết định tự động</tspan></text>
      <text x="76" y="294" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>with legal or life-altering effects.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gây hệ quả pháp lý hay đổi đời.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="470" y="238" width="410" height="80" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <DiagramIcon name="log" x={498} y={278} size={26} />
      <text x="526" y="260" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>EU AI Act (2024/1689)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đạo luật AI của EU (2024/1689)</tspan></text>
      <text x="526" y="278" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>High-risk systems need audit logs,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hệ thống rủi ro cao cần nhật ký kiểm toán,</tspan></text>
      <text x="526" y="294" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>data governance, human oversight.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>quản trị dữ liệu, người giám sát.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>On the left a named person owns the call. On the right nobody does, which is the gap the law now tries to close.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bên trái có một người cụ thể chịu trách nhiệm. Bên phải thì không ai, và đó là khoảng trống luật đang cố lấp.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .eac { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .eac-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .eac svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .eac text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .eac .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .eac .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .eac .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .eac .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .eac .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .eac .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .eac .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .eac .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .eac .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .eac .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .eac .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .eac .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .eac .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .eac .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .eac .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .eac .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .eac .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .eac .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .eac .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .eac .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .eac .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .eac .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .eac .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .eac figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
